flowchart TD
    Student["C code + assignment ID + request ID"]
    Check["Check session, ownership, version<br/>Reject disabled version"]
    Job["Save submission and queue job"]
    Template["Build files from approved test template<br/>Julien"]
    Runner["Judge0 isolated runner<br/>Garance"]
    Compile["Compile C"]
    Tests["Run public and private cases<br/>Enforce execution limits"]
    Memory["Memory checker<br/>Only after setup is verified"]
    Result["Backend interprets results<br/>No private test details in student response"]
    Save["Save result once<br/>First completion updates progress"]
    Page["Student polls submission result"]
    Failure["Service failure<br/>Retry without learning penalty"]
    Student --> Check
    Check --> Job
    Job --> Template
    Template --> Runner
    Runner --> Compile
    Compile --> Tests
    Tests -.-> Memory
    Compile -->|"Compilation error"| Result
    Tests --> Result
    Memory --> Result
    Runner -->|"Infrastructure problem"| Failure
    Failure --> Save
    Result --> Save
    Save --> Page
